# =============================================================================
# Project : Project 3 - Python App CI/CD on Azure AKS
# Author  : Sanjay Naidu
# File    : .dockerignore - keep the build context small and secret-free
# =============================================================================
# Everything not needed inside the image is excluded. A small context means
# faster builds and no risk of leaking state files or CI config into layers.

.git
.github
.gitignore
.venv
venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.coverage
coverage.xml
tests/
terraform/
helm/
docs/
README.md
LICENSE
sonar-project.properties
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.env
